T1  - Sóley: Automated detection of logic vulnerabilities in Ethereum smart contracts using large language models
AU  - Soud, Majd
AU  - Nuutinen, Waltteri
AU  - Liebel, Grischa
JO  - Journal of Systems and Software
VL  - 226
SP  - 112406
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/08/01/
