T1  - OpenFix: leveraging graph representation and LLM knowledge augmentation for prompt-guided vulnerability repair in smart infrastructures
AU  - Xiang, Zhenglin
AU  - Gao, Yating
AU  - Hu, Wei
AU  - Li, Gaolei
AU  - Yang, Xiao
AU  - Zhang, Quanhai
JO  - International Journal of Pervasive Computing and Communications
